:: Deadwood Raven Shrine Talk
<<effects>><<deadwood-raven-shrine-presence>>
<<if !_shrine or _shrine.stage isnot 3 or $location isnot 'forest_raven_shrine'>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You are no longer at the shrine.' '你已经不在神社了。'>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-raven-shrine-return>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if !_shrinePerson or C.npc.Tsukihan.init isnot 1>>
  <<lanSwitch 'The veranda is empty. Tsukihan has other things to do; you can visit another time.' '廊下空着。月羽还有自己的事要忙，改天再来吧。'>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-raven-shrine-return>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<npc Tsukihan>><<person1>>
<<if _shrine.scene is 'talk'>>
  <<if _shrine.step is ''>>
    <<switch _shrine.topic>>
      <<case 'shrine'>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            You ask who built the shrine. Tsukihan looks up at the red gate.
            "Someone who missed home, I think. The oldest papers are mostly accounts and lists of names. No grand revelation, I'm afraid."<br><br>
            <<He>> shows you a receipt for roof tiles. Someone has added a small bird in the margin.
            "I learnt the rites from the last person who cared for this place."
            <<if _shrine.donations gte 10000>>"You can see where the new tiles start. We used to put a bucket underneath. I still look up when it rains." <<He>> smiles at the receipt.
            <<elseif _shrine.donations gte 5000>>"The pond shelter has been worth the trouble. Visitors stay a little longer now. Sometimes I do, too."
            <<elseif _shrine.donations gte 2500>>"The new cushions are easier on the knees. I've kept one of the old covers; it has enough good cloth left to mend something."
            <<else>>"Before anything else, they taught me where to put the buckets when it rains."<</if>>
          <<option 'CN'>>
            你问起神社是谁建的。月羽抬头看了看红门。
            “大概是想家的人吧。留下来的旧纸，多是账目和人名。没找到什么惊天动地的秘密。”<br><br>
            <<He>>给你看一张买瓦的收据，页角还画着只小鸟。
            “祭仪是跟上一位照料这里的人学的。”
            <<if _shrine.donations gte 10000>>“上面颜色浅的，就是换过的瓦。以前底下要摆个桶。现在下雨，还是忍不住先抬头看看。”<<He>>对着那张收据笑了一下。
            <<elseif _shrine.donations gte 5000>>“池边的棚子，搭起来倒真值了。来的人肯多坐一会儿。有时，我也跟着坐久些。”
            <<elseif _shrine.donations gte 2500>>“新坐垫坐着没那么硌膝盖。旧的面子还留了一块，有些布还好，能补点别的。”
            <<else>>“不过先学会的，是下雨时该把水桶放在哪儿。”<</if>>
        <</language>>
      <<case 'birds'>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            You ask whether Tsukihan can tell the ravens apart. "Most of them. That one's missing a claw. That one opens bags. And that one waits for the others to open bags."<br><br>
            The last bird fluffs itself up. Tsukihan gives it a level look.
            "Yes, you. I watched you do it." <<He>> turns back to you. "They remember people who feed them. They remember people who throw things, too. I wouldn't try that."
          <<option 'CN'>>
            你问月羽能不能分清这些渡鸦。“大多认得。那只少一枚爪子，那只会拆袋子。还有那只，专等别的鸟拆开袋子。”<br><br>
            最后一只蓬起了毛。月羽看着它。
            “就是你。我亲眼看见的。”<<He>>转回头，“它们会记住喂过自己的人，也记得拿东西砸过它们的人。后面这件事就别试了。”
        <</language>>
      <<case 'town'>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            You tell Tsukihan about town. <<He>> listens while folding a shopping list into quarters.
            "I go down when we need supplies. Usually I get as far as the shop and remember three things I forgot to write down."<br><br>
            You notice biscuits at the bottom of the list. "For visitors," <<he>> says. Then, after a pause, "And me. They're rather good with tea."
          <<option 'CN'>>
            你说起镇上的事。月羽一边听，一边把采购单折成小小的一方。
            “缺东西时会下山。往往刚到店里，就想起还有三样没写上去。”<br><br>
            你瞥见单子最下面写着饼干。“给客人的。”<<he>>说，停了一下，又添上一句，“也给我自己。配茶挺好吃。”
        <</language>>
      <<case 'personal'>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            <<if $speech_attitude is 'bratty'>>You glance at the tools and tease Tsukihan about spending even a quiet afternoon working.
            <<elseif $speech_attitude is 'meek'>>You tentatively ask what Tsukihan likes doing when there is no work to finish.
            <<else>>You ask what Tsukihan does with a quiet afternoon.<</if>><br><br>
            "I mend things. I read. Sometimes I start mending something and spend an hour looking for the tool I put down." Tsukihan pauses.
            <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>"Occasionally. The work does get done." <<He>> squares the cloth on <<his>> knee.
            <<else>><<He>> smiles at you. "Now you know. I always think I will remember where it is."<</if>><br><br>
            <<if isLoveInterest('Tsukihan') and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20>>
              <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>
                <<He>> sets the cloth down. "Today, I want you to stay for a little while. Just because I have chores doesn't mean I only want help with them."
              <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 30>>
                "Lately I keep looking up whenever I hear footsteps." <<He>> meets your eyes briefly. "I suppose you know why."
              <<else>>
                "There are usually spare cushions." <<He>> straightens the one beside <<him>>. "If you happen to come by."
              <</if>>
            <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>
              "Your turn. I can't always be the one finding something to talk about." <<He>> turns the cloth over, then looks up again, waiting for you to begin.
            <<else>>
              "What about you?" <<He>> waits for your answer, hands folded neatly on the cloth.
            <</if>>
          <<option 'CN'>>
            <<if $speech_attitude is 'bratty'>>你瞥了眼工具，打趣月羽，难得清闲下来也要找点活做。
            <<elseif $speech_attitude is 'meek'>>你小心地问起月羽不忙时的消遣。
            <<else>>你问月羽，清闲的下午一般怎么过。<</if>><br><br>
            “补补东西，看看书。有时东西没补上，倒花了一个钟头找刚放下的工具。”话一出口，月羽就顿了顿。
            <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom lt 30>>“只是偶尔。该做的事都有做完。”<<He>>把膝上的布叠得更整齐了些。
            <<else>><<He>>朝你笑了笑。“倒让你听见了。我放东西时明明都记得。”<</if>><br><br>
            <<if isLoveInterest('Tsukihan') and C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 20>>
              <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>
                <<He>>把布放下。“今天想让你多陪一会儿。我这里有活干，又不是只想让你帮忙。”
              <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 30>>
                “最近一听见脚步声，就会抬头看看。”<<He>>短暂地望进你的眼睛。“为什么，你应该猜得到吧。”
              <<else>>
                “廊下的坐垫，平时有空着的。”<<He>>理了理身旁那一只。“要是你恰好路过。”
              <</if>>
            <<elseif C.npc.Tsukihan.dom gte 70>>
              “轮到你了。总不能回回都由我找话说。”<<He>>把布翻过来，又抬眼看看你，等着你开口。
            <<else>>
              “你呢？”<<He>>把手整齐地放在布上，等着你的回答。
            <</if>>
        <</language>>
    <</switch>><br><br>
    <<set _shrineRepliesText to {
      shrine: [['Ask about the wishes left here', '问问留下的心愿'], ['Talk about somewhere you miss', '说说自己惦念的地方'], ['Look through the old receipts together', '一起翻看旧收据']],
      birds: [['Ask about the letter deliveries', '问问信是怎么送的'], ['Tell Tsukihan about feeding the birds', '说说你喂鸟的经历'], ['Watch the ravens on the railing', '看看栏杆上的渡鸦']],
      town: [['Ask what supplies are needed', '问问还缺什么东西'], ['Mention something you saw in town', '说件在镇上碰到的事'], ['Check the shopping list together', '一起核对采购单']],
      personal: [['Ask what Tsukihan has been reading', '问问月羽最近在看什么'], ['Talk about your day', '说说今天过得怎么样'], ['Enjoy a little quiet together', '安静地陪一会儿']]
    }>>
    <<for _replyIndex, _reply range ['ask', 'tell', 'listen']>>
      <<capture _replyIndex _reply>>
        <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink _shrineRepliesText[_shrine.topic][_replyIndex] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Talk'>><<deadwood-raven-shrine-step _reply 'talk'>><</lanLink>><br>
      <</capture>>
    <</for>>
    <<if _shrine.topic is 'personal'>>
      <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Ask about shrine business instead', '还是聊聊神社的事务'] 'Deadwood Raven Shrine Talk'>><<deadwood-raven-shrine-step 'formal' 'talk'>><</lanLink>><<deadwood-tsukihan-wilfulness-hint -1>><br>
    <</if>>
  <<else>>
    <<switch _shrine.step>>
      <<case 'ask'>>
        <<if _shrine.topic is 'birds'>>
          <<lanSwitch 'You ask about the letter. "The birds carry things between places they know. Whether the right person gets them is another matter." Tsukihan points at a chewed cord. "We lost two lists before yours. Thank you for bringing it all the way."' '你问起那封信。“它们会把东西带到认识的地方。最后是不是到了该收信的人手里，就得另说了。”月羽指指被啄烂的细绳。“你那封之前，已经丢了两张清单。谢谢你特意送来。”'>>
        <<elseif _shrine.topic is 'shrine'>>
          <<lanSwitch 'You ask whether people still leave wishes. "They do. Some want someone to come home; others want the courage to leave." Tsukihan puts the old receipt away. "I keep their names to myself. You can leave yours unwritten, if you prefer."' '你问现在还有没有人来留下心愿。“有。有人盼着谁回家，也有人想有勇气离开。”月羽收起旧收据。“他们的名字，我就不讲了。你若想祈愿，也不必一定写下来。”'>>
          <<if _shrine.wish.shared>>
            <br><br>
            <<if _shrine.wish.returned>>
              <<lanSwitch '"Yours is still there," <<he>> adds. "The one you came back for. I moved it out of the rain." <<He>> points out the sheltered end of the rack.' '“你那块也还在。”<<He>>又说，“回来还过愿的那块。我挪到淋不到雨的地方了。”<<He>>指指木架靠里的一端。'>>
            <<elseif _shrine.wish.kind is 'study'>>
              <<lanSwitch '"How are your lessons going?" <<He>> turns the pencil between <<his>> fingers. "You can bring your books next time. I can find you a quiet place to read."' '“课上还顺利么？”<<He>>转了转手里的铅笔，“下次可以把书带来。能给你找个安静看书的地方。”'>>
            <<elseif _shrine.wish.kind is 'harvest'>>
              <<lanSwitch '"You were hoping for fruit, weren\'t you? I checked the supports this morning. We can look at the branches later."' '“你盼着果树有个好收成，是不是？早上看过木架了。等会儿可以一起去看看枝条。”'>>
            <<else>>
              <<lanSwitch '"And yours?" <<He>> looks towards the gate. "Whenever you come back up, let me know you made it."' '“你那件呢？”<<He>>望了一眼院门，“往后走上来，记得跟我打个招呼，好知道你到了。”'>>
            <</if>>
          <</if>>
        <<elseif _shrine.topic is 'personal'>>
          <<lanSwitch 'You ask what Tsukihan has been reading. <<He>> holds up a book with a scrap of cloth tucked between the pages. "Someone left it here. I meant to read a chapter, but it got dark before I noticed." <<He>> turns it over to show you the title. "You can borrow it when I finish. Tell me whether you think the ending will be any good."' '你问月羽最近在看什么书。<<He>>举起一本夹着碎布条的书。“有人落在这儿的。本来只想看一章，回过神来天都黑了。”<<He>>翻过封面，给你看书名。“等我看完，可以借你。先猜猜看，结尾会不会写得好。”'>>
        <<else>>
          <<lanSwitch 'Tsukihan answers your questions, then asks a few of <<his>> own. Before long, you have both forgotten the shopping list. "Now I\'ve thought of another thing to put on it," <<he>> says, reaching for a pencil.' '月羽回答了你的问题，也反过来问了几句。聊着聊着，两人都把采购单忘在了一旁。“这下又想起一件该买的了。”<<he>>说着，去拿铅笔。'>>
        <</if>>
      <<case 'tell' 'advice' 'listen_more'>>
        <<switch _shrine.topic>>
          <<case 'shrine'>>
            <<lanSwitch 'You talk about a place you miss. Tsukihan leaves the receipt on the table and listens. "I know the road down the hill by heart now. Sometimes I still dream I took a different turning." <<He>> rubs a faded corner of the paper. "It helps to have somewhere to come back to."' '你说起自己惦念的地方。月羽把收据留在桌上，听了一会儿。“下山的路，早就走熟了。有时做梦，还是会梦见拐进另一条路。”<<He>>抚过纸张褪色的一角。“有个能回来的地方，总是好些。”'>>
          <<case 'birds'>>
            <<lanSwitch 'You describe the flock taking fruit from you. Tsukihan listens until you mention the bird that stayed behind. "The one with the pale claw? It waits until the others finish fighting." <<He>> points towards a bird on the railing. "That one. Don\'t let it pretend it hasn\'t eaten."' '你说起鸟群从你手边取走水果的样子。提到最后还不肯走的那只时，月羽抬起头。“爪子颜色浅的那只？它总等别的鸟争完。”<<He>>指指栏杆上的一只。“就是它。别让它装成没吃过。”'>>
          <<case 'town'>>
            <<lanSwitch 'You mention something you saw in town. Tsukihan asks which street, then compares it with the route on the back of the list. "I keep taking the longer way round." <<He>> crosses out a turn. "Next time, tell me before I leave the gate."' '你说起镇上碰见的事。月羽问清是哪条街，又翻过清单，看看背面写的路线。“原来我一直在绕路。”<<He>>划掉一处拐弯。“下次有这种事，趁我还没出门就告诉我。”'>>
          <<case 'personal'>>
            <<lanSwitch 'You tell Tsukihan about your day. <<He>> listens without looking back at the work on the table. <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 50 and isLoveInterest("Tsukihan")>>"Next time, come before you wear yourself out." <<He>> pauses. "I\'d like to hear about the good parts, too."<<else>>"You can sit here a little longer. I won\'t put a broom in your hands." <<He>> moves the tools to the other end of the veranda.<</if>>' '你说起今天过得怎么样。月羽听着，没有再去看桌上的活。<<if C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 50 and isLoveInterest("Tsukihan")>>“下回来早点，别等累成这样。”<<He>>顿了顿。“顺心的事，也想听你讲。”<<else>>“想歇就多坐会儿。我不会塞把扫帚给你的。”<<He>>把工具挪到廊子的另一头。<</if>>'>>
        <</switch>>
      <<case 'formal'>>
        <<lanSwitch 'You keep the conversation on the shrine and its visitors. Tsukihan straightens the papers between you and answers in the same measured tone. When you leave a subject alone, <<he>> does too. Soon you are comparing which part of the path needs clearing next.' '你把话题留在神社和来客上。月羽理齐你们中间的纸张，用同样平稳的语调回答。你没再细问的事，<<he>>也没有提起。后来，你们说起了参道上下一处该清理的地方。'>>
      <<case 'listen'>>
        <<switch _shrine.topic>>
          <<case 'shrine'>>
            <<lanSwitch 'You turn the old receipts over together. One lists a roof repair; another records a wedding. Tsukihan points out a name that appears on both. "The carpenter. They were paid in food that winter." <<He>> lays a fresh sheet beneath the brittle paper before you turn the next page.' '你们一起翻看旧收据。一张记着修屋顶的钱，另一张却是婚礼的开销。月羽指给你看两处相同的名字。“木匠。那年冬天，工钱是拿粮食抵的。”翻到下一页前，<<he>>先给脆旧的纸垫了一张新的。'>>
          <<case 'birds'>>
            <<lanSwitch 'A raven tries to squeeze between two others on the railing. Tsukihan moves the tray before the jostling birds reach it. "Every morning," <<he>> says. A fourth bird lands on the space they have just left. Tsukihan gives you a look, and you both have to hold back a laugh.' '一只渡鸦想挤到栏杆上另外两只中间。月羽赶在它们蹬翻浅盘前，把盘子移开。“每天早上都这样。”第四只鸟这时落下来，正好占了它们让出来的位置。月羽朝你看了一眼，你们都忍了忍笑。'>>
          <<case 'town'>>
            <<lanSwitch 'You read out the list while Tsukihan checks the cupboard. Lamp oil, cord, flour. <<He>> comes back for the pencil when you reach the biscuits. "Put those down too. A proper packet this time." <<He>> adds a second line beneath them, then turns the paper over before you can read it.' '你照着清单念，月羽去柜里一件件核对。灯油、绳子、面粉。念到饼干时，<<he>>回来取铅笔。“那个也添上。这次买整包的。”<<He>>又在下方补了一行，没等你看清，就把纸翻了过去。'>>
          <<case 'personal'>>
            <<lanSwitch 'You sit without filling the silence. Tsukihan watches the light creep along the boards. After a while, <<he>> puts the work away rather than picking it up again. <<if C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 50 and isLoveInterest("Tsukihan")>>"I was hoping you wouldn\'t leave yet," <<he>> says.<<else>>"I keep meaning to stop before it gets dark," <<he>> says. "This is better."<</if>>' '你们坐着，没有急着找话说。月羽看着天光沿廊板慢慢挪过去。过了一会儿，<<he>>把手边的活收了起来。<<if C.npc.Tsukihan.love gte 50 and isLoveInterest("Tsukihan")>>“刚才就想让你多坐一会儿。”<<he>>说。<<else>>“总说天黑前就歇，回回又做过了头。”<<he>>说，“这样倒好。”<</if>>'>>
        <</switch>>
    <</switch>><<lstress>><<glove>><br><br>
  <</if>>
<<elseif _shrine.talk is Math.floor(Time.days)>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Tsukihan picks up the unfinished cloth again. "I\'d better finish this before I lose the thread. Come and tell me the rest tomorrow."' '月羽重新拿起没收好的布。“趁还记得做到哪儿，先把它弄完吧。剩下的明天再说给我听。”'>><br><br>
<<elseif _shrineMinutes lte 10>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Tsukihan checks the fading light. "I\'m about to close up. I can say hello, but a proper chat will have to wait until tomorrow."' '月羽看了看渐暗的天色。“快要收拾关门了。打个招呼还行，细聊得等明天。”'>><br><br>
<<elseif $daily.no_sing or $worn.face.type.includes('gag')>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You cannot speak clearly. Tsukihan makes room for you to sit without pressing you for an answer.' '你说不清话。月羽给你腾出坐的位置，没有催着你回答。'>><br><br>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Tsukihan is on the veranda. You can join <<him>> there.' '月羽在廊下，可以过去坐坐。'>><br><br>
<</if>>
<br><<deadwood-raven-shrine-return 'veranda'>>
